#. module: library_manager
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:library_manager.field_library_member__type
msgid ""
"- Contact: Use this to organize the contact details of employees of a given company (e.g. CEO, CFO, ...).\n"
"- Invoice Address: Preferred address for all invoices. Selected by default when you invoice an order that belongs to this company.\n"
"- Delivery Address: Preferred address for all deliveries. Selected by default when you deliver an order that belongs to this company.\n"
"- Other: Other address for the company (e.g. subsidiary, ...)"
msgstr ""
"- Contacto: sirve para organizar los datos de contacto de los empleados de una empresa (p. ej., director general, director financiero...).\n"
"- Dirección de facturación: dirección preferida para todas las facturas. Se selecciona por defecto al facturar un pedido de esta empresa.\n"
"- Dirección de entrega: dirección preferida para todas las entregas. Se selecciona por defecto al entregar un pedido de esta empresa.\n"
"- Otra: otra dirección de la empresa (p. ej., una filial...)"

#. module: library_manager
#: model:mail.template,body_html:library_manager.mail_template_library_loan_overdue
msgid ""
"<div>\n"
"                <p>Hello <t t-out=\"object.member_id.name or ''\"></t>,</p>\n"
"                <p>The return deadline for the following book has passed:</p>\n"
"                <ul>\n"
"                    <li><strong>Book:</strong> <t t-out=\"object.book_id.name\"></t></li>\n"
"                    <li><strong>Loan:</strong> <t t-out=\"object.name\"></t></li>\n"
"                    <li><strong>Due date:</strong> <t t-out=\"object.due_date\"></t></li>\n"
"                </ul>\n"
"                <p>Please return the book, or contact the library if you already did.</p>\n"
"                <p>Thank you,<br>The Library</p>\n"
"            </div>\n"
"        "
msgstr ""
"<div>\n"
"                <p style=\"margin:0px 0 16px 0;box-sizing:border-box;\">Hola <t t-out=\"object.member_id.name or ''\"></t>,</p>\n"
"                <p style=\"margin:0px 0 16px 0;box-sizing:border-box;\">Te avisamos de que ha vencido el plazo de devolución de este libro:</p>\n"
"                <ul style=\"padding:0 0 0 32px;margin:0px 0 16px 0;box-sizing:border-box;list-style-type:disc;\">\n"
"                    <li><strong style=\"box-sizing:border-box;font-weight:bolder;\">Libro:</strong> <t t-out=\"object.book_id.name\"></t></li>\n"
"                    <li><strong style=\"box-sizing:border-box;font-weight:bolder;\">Préstamo:</strong> <t t-out=\"object.name\"></t></li>\n"
"                    <li><strong style=\"box-sizing:border-box;font-weight:bolder;\">Fecha límite:</strong> <t t-out=\"object.due_date\"></t></li>\n"
"                </ul>\n"
"                <p style=\"margin:0px 0 16px 0;box-sizing:border-box;\">Por favor, devuelve el libro o ponte en contacto con la biblioteca si ya lo has devuelto.</p>\n"
"                <p style=\"margin:0px 0 16px 0;box-sizing:border-box;\">Gracias,<br>Biblioteca</p>\n"
"            </div>\n"
"        "

